# reShapr UI Control — agent context

## Repositories

- **This workspace**: SvelteKit SPA console for the Reshapr control plane (`src/lib/api/client.ts` = same REST paths as the [Reshapr](https://github.com/reshaprio/reshapr) CLI). UI: Tailwind + shadcn-svelte.
- **Backend / CLI**: not in this repo. Clone [reshapr](https://github.com/reshaprio/reshapr) for Quarkus (`control-plane/`) and the TypeScript CLI (`cli/`).

